cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Dyson tree: a pre-registered carbon-budget model for photosynthesis under 1/r^2 insolation"
abstract: >-
  A minimal, pre-registered carbon-budget model for a single photosynthetic
  organism at heliocentric distance r, with a browser explorer. Three questions
  were registered and run; exactly one of their predictions held. The findings
  are reported falsifications-first in docs/FINDINGS.md.
type: software
